    description: Some("A one-player game that needs both joysticks at once: one walks Indy and uses whatever object is selected, the other slides the selector along an inventory strip holding six items. Finding the Ark is a matter of working out which object to be holding, and where, from the Cairo marketplace down into the Temple of the Ancients."),
